# Ramos, Dragon Engine: "put a +1/+1 counter on Ramos for each of that spell's colors" counts the colors the spell has as the
# ability resolves (CR 608.2h), not as it was cast. Bot1 casts Ramos turn 1 ({6}: Black Lotus and three Moxen). On turn 3
# Bot1 casts Terminate ({B}{R}) at Bot2's Memnite; with Ramos's trigger waiting, Bot2 answers with Thoughtlace on the
# Terminate, which is then blue alone. Ramos gets one counter (5/5), not two. Thoughtlace is Bot2's spell, so it adds nothing.

